<title>FRANCE: EU sells German intervention barley.</title>
<headline>EU sells German intervention barley.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee on Thursday sold 234,324 tonnes of German intervention barley at a minimum price of 105.07 Ecus per tonne for export to non-EU countries, European grain sources said.</p>
</text>
